e\"></span></div><h1 class=\"j8ab0G_heroTitle\">Confiabilidade <span class=\"j8ab0G_accentLine\">com profundidade.</span></h1><p class=\"j8ab0G_heroDescription\">Cibersegurança, infraestrutura em nuvem e software para operações críticas.</p><div class=\"j8ab0G_heroActions\"><a href=\"#contato\" class=\"j8ab0G_primaryCta\">Solicitar diagnóstico<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section data-sec=\"pilares\" data-screen-label=\"Princípios\" class=\"j8ab0G_principles\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_inner\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_eyebrowRow\"><span class=\"j8ab0G_eyebrow\">Nossos princípios</span><span class=\"j8ab0G_eyebrowRule\"></span></div><h2 class=\"j8ab0G_principlesTitle\">Tecnologia que se explica. <span class=\"j8ab0G_accentLine\">Presença que permanece.</span></h2><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleGrid\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleBorder\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleCard\"><h3 class=\"j8ab0G_principleTitle\">Clareza que traduz</h3><div class=\"j8ab0G_dividerTop\"></div><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleArt\"><div class=\"_6BkjRW_art \" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-graphic=\"diamante\" data-graphic-status=\"loading\"><canvas class=\"_6BkjRW_canvas\" style=\"visibility:hidden\"></canvas><img data-graphic-fallback=\"true\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"566\" height=\"506\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"_6BkjRW_fallback\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/assets/simbolo-negativo.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"j8ab0G_divider\"></div><p class=\"j8ab0G_principleDescription\">Explicamos tecnologia em termos de negócio. Se não ficou claro para quem decide, a gente reescreve.</p><div class=\"j8ab0G_practiceRow\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_practiceText\"><span class=\"j8ab0G_practiceLabel\">Na prática</span><span class=\"j8ab0G_practiceDescription\">Relatórios em linguagem de negócio</span></div><a href=\"#contato\" aria-label=\"Falar sobre clareza que traduz\" class=\"j8ab0G_cutCta\"><span class=\"j8ab0G_cutCtaInner\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleBorder\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleCard\"><h3 class=\"j8ab0G_principleTitle\">Presença que ampara</h3><div class=\"j8ab0G_dividerTop\"></div><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleArt\"><div class=\"_6BkjRW_art \" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-graphic=\"cadeado\" data-graphic-status=\"loading\"><canvas class=\"_6BkjRW_canvas\" style=\"visibility:hidden\"></canvas><img data-graphic-fallback=\"true\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"566\" height=\"506\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"_6BkjRW_fallback\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/assets/simbolo-negativo.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"j8ab0G_divider\"></div><p class=\"j8ab0G_principleDescription\">Ficamos por perto antes, durante e depois da entrega. Com firmeza e segurança, sem alarmismo.</p><div class=\"j8ab0G_practiceRow\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_practiceText\"><span class=\"j8ab0G_practiceLabel\">Na prática</span><span class=\"j8ab0G_practiceDescription\">Suporte próximo e contínuo</span></div><a href=\"#contato\" aria-label=\"Falar sobre presença que ampara\" class=\"j8ab0G_cutCta\"><span class=\"j8ab0G_cutCtaInner\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleBorder\"><div class=\"j8ab0G_principleCard\"><h3 class=\"j8ab0G_principleTitle\">Profundidade que inspira confiança</h3><div class=\"j8ab0G_dividerTop\"></div><div class=